<h3>What is Insomnia?</h3>
<p>Insomnia is a common sleep disorder that affects your ability to fall asleep, stay asleep, or get restful sleep. Chronic insomnia can lead to fatigue, mood issues, poor focus, and long-term health problems.</p>
<p>You may be experiencing insomnia if you:</p>
<ul>
<li>Take more than 30 minutes to fall asleep</li>
<li>Wake up frequently at night</li>
<li>Feel tired even after 7–8 hours in bed</li>
<li>Rely on substances (alcohol, melatonin, THC) to sleep</li>
<li>Worry constantly about not sleeping</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
