<div class="dm-full">
<h3>Types of Insomnia We Treat</h3>
<ul>
<li>Chronic Insomnia (lasting 3+ nights/week for 3+ months)</li>
<li>Short-Term Insomnia (related to stress, illness, etc.)</li>
<li>Comorbid Insomnia (linked to anxiety, depression, trauma)</li>
<li>Sleep Onset &amp; Sleep Maintenance Problems</li>
<li>Postpartum or Perimenopausal Sleep Disruption</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
