<h3>How We Diagnose Sleep Problems</h3>
<p>Your initial evaluation includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>A detailed sleep history and behavioral sleep assessment</li>
<li>Screening for related issues (e.g., anxiety, PTSD, substance use)</li>
<li>Rule-out for sleep apnea and other medical causes (via referral)</li>
</ul>
<p>We determine if insomnia is primary or secondary, and match you with the best treatment approach.</p>
